flowchart TB
    MIDI([MIDI Score]):::input

    subgraph LT [<b>Logic Track</b> · deterministic judge]
        direction TB
        ArLSTM[ArLSTM<br/>Ramoneda 2022<br/>PIG-finetuned]:::primary
        ArLSTM_alt[/pianoplayer DP<br/>Parncutt 1997/]:::alt
    end

    subgraph VT [<b>Visual Track</b> · anatomy renderer]
        direction TB
        biomech[biomech v4<br/>Viterbi + IK<br/>locked 2026-05-15]:::neutral
    end

    fingering[/per-note hand-finger<br/>decisions/]:::data
    motion[/MANO 3D pose<br/>trajectory/]:::data

    StageB[Stage B<br/>simple_natural.py<br/>--fingering arlstm]:::stage
    rendered([rendered mp4<br/>正確指法 + anatomical 渲染]):::output

    StageC[Stage C<br/>PracticeScreen<br/>+ WebSocket feedback]:::stage
    student([student practices<br/>in browser]):::output

    MIDI --> ArLSTM
    MIDI -.ablation.-> ArLSTM_alt
    MIDI --> biomech

    ArLSTM --> fingering
    biomech --> motion
    fingering --> StageB
    motion --> StageB
    StageB --> rendered
    rendered --> StageC
    StageC --> student

    classDef input fill:#1a4d8f,color:#fff,stroke:#0a2d5f
